  "description": "ASP.NET Core webhook signature verification done right. Verifies inbound webhooks against the raw request body using a pinned algorithm, constant-time comparison, and timestamp replay protection — closing the classic pitfalls (algorithm confusion, alg:none, timing attacks, replay). Built-in presets for Stripe, GitHub, Shopify, and Slack; generic HMAC (symmetric) and RSA/ECDSA (asymmetric public-key) verification for anything else. Drop-in via an endpoint filter, an MVC attribute, or middleware.",
  "id": "WebhookGuard",
