  "releaseNotes": "Initial release: HMAC (Stripe/GitHub/Shopify/Slack presets + generic) and asymmetric RSA/ECDSA verification, with pinned algorithms, constant-time comparison, replay protection, and raw-body verification. Available as an endpoint filter, MVC attribute, and middleware.",
